# CODEOWNERS -- enforcement surface. Step one toward required code-owner review.
# GitHub auto-requests the owner's review on any PR touching these paths.
# Required code-owner approval is DEFERRED until a second reviewer identity exists
# (GitHub forbids self-approval on a single-collaborator repo). Do not turn on
# "require review from code owners" in branch protection until then.
# Every gate-shaped tool (tools/*_lint.py, *_check.py, *_gate.py, verify_*.py) must
# have an owner line here: tests/test_codeowners.py fails when one does not.

